                <pb facs="0120" n="108" sameAs="frus:frus1945v05/pg108"/>

                <head>Agreement between the United States and Norway respecting certain problems of
                    marine transportation and litigation, effected by exchange of notes signed May
                    29, 1945</head>
                <p>[For text of agreement, signed at Washington, see Department of State Executive
                    Agreement Series No. 471, or 59 Stat. (pt. 2) 1541. This agreement was
                    terminated October 29, 1945, as a result of written <pb facs="0121" n="109"
                        xml:id="pg109"/> notice given by the Norwegian Government on September 29,
                    1945, in accordance with article 5 (2) of the agreement (411.57
                    Ships/9–2945).]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
